"""
CiteVerify backend: a single-file FastAPI service.

Pipeline: upload -> text extraction -> claim extraction -> citation detection -> reference mapping
-> paper retrieval (demo corpus / Crossref / Semantic Scholar / OpenAlex) -> evidence extraction
-> semantic + statistical comparison -> verdict -> report.

Run:  uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000
"""
